<title>FRANCE: OECD - Key forecast by half year - OECD area.</title>
<headline>OECD - Key forecast by half year - OECD area.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are economic forecasts for OECD countries, made by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development and published on Thursday it is half-year economic report.</p>
<p>		     1996  1997  1998     1996	1997	1998</p>
<p>		     year  year  year    H1  H2    H1  H2    H1  H2</p>
<p> Real GDP	   2.6   3.0   2.7   2.9  2.8  3.4  2.6  2.6  2.8</p>
<p>(pct change annual rate)</p>
<p> Inflation pct    4.2   3.7   3.4   4.3  3.7  3.8  3.7  3.4  3.1</p>
<p>(GDP deflator)</p>
<p>Current account -0.2  -0.1  -0.1  -0.1 -0.2 -0.2 -0.1 -0.1 -0.1</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Unemployment     7.5   7.3   7.1   7.5  7.4  7.3  7.2  7.2  7.1</p>
<p>(pct of labour force)</p>
</text>
